{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Birdwatchers, gather around!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We\u2019ve made a cozy desktop birdwatching game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place your postcard \u2014 a little window to another world \u2014 right in the corner of your screen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your birdwatching spot freely.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If a bird happens to like it, it might just stop by for a visit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join us on discord!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5c808611b9eec3083a405c14313ac6aa.avif?t=1768898988\" width=1280 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Docks, beaches, deserts, rainforests\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each location has its own scenery and special bird spicies to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/147af5572ccea30b6096d43345155ac6.poster.avif?t=1768898988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/147af5572ccea30b6096d43345155ac6.webm?t=1768898988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/147af5572ccea30b6096d43345155ac6.mp4?t=1768898988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2e5c2ac87cd240eddc33b9f5d642d663.avif?t=1768898988\" width=1280 height=177 /></span></p><p class=