static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/facc621273982a56648a93e132812e6b.avif?t=1768898988\" width=1280 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Birds will bring all sorts of little treasures \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">colorful feathers, bottle caps, and maybe\u2026 something more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.poster.avif?t=1768898988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.webm?t=1768898988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.mp4?t=1768898988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/9253e0a25189ddd2d3e36d382c12ca4a.avif?t=1768898988\" width=1280 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He loves everything shiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trade your sparkly finds \u2014 feathers, trinkets, and more \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and he\u2019ll gladly exchange them for coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.poster.avif?t=1768898988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.webm?t=1768898988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.mp4?t=1768898988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Online co-op, photography, and blueprint sharing are under development. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> you're going to share beautiful scene and story with your friends!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111370?t=1768898988","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/afa4f4c0671a11a9df0b4aceebaaecafca51432c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768898988","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/d4a71423180ba0a3dd7a4cdb000a4df30207cc76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768898988","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/d4a71423180ba0a3dd7a4cdb000a4df30207cc76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768898988","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Birdwatchers, gather around!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We\u2019ve made a cozy desktop birdwatching game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place your postcard \u2014 a little window to another world \u2014 right in the corner of your screen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your birdwatching spot freely.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If a bird happens to like it, it might just stop by for a visit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>